---
layout: base.njk
pagination: { data: stats.bots, size: 1, alias: b }
permalink: "/bots/{{ b.token }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ b.token | name }} in robots.txt"
  description: "How many sites block {{ b.token | name }} ({{ b.operator }}), measured in robots.txt files."
---
<h1>{{ b.token | name }}</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ b.operator }} crawler, type: {{ b.category | cat }}.</p>
<ul class="tiles">
<li><strong>{{ b.mentioned | n }}</strong><span>sites name it in robots.txt</span></li>
<li><strong>{{ b.blocked | n }}</strong><span>block it fully ({{ b.pct_blocked_of_mentions }}%)</span></li>
<li><strong>{{ b.partial | n }}</strong><span>block some paths</span></li>
<li><strong>{{ b.allowed | n }}</strong><span>allow it explicitly</span></li>
</ul>
<p>Including sites that block it only through the <code>*</code> group, {{ b.eff_pct }}% of all sites with a robots.txt keep it out.</p>
<p><a href="/bots/">All AI crawlers</a></p>
